type enlng
class Shape:
    remember label as "shape"
    method area:
        give 0
    method show_me:
        show label of self "area" ask self to area
class Square inherits from Shape:
    remember side as 1
    method area:
        give side of self times side of self
remember s as new Square with label as "sq", side as 4
tell s to show_me
remember new as 5
remember call as 6
remember class as 7
show new plus call plus class
remember a as 3
remember b as 4
show a plus b
freeze fixed as new Square with side as 2
function poke with o:
    side of o = 99
try:
    poke(fixed)
on error as e:
    show "frozen:" e
show side of fixed
show s is a Shape
